sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (ERP / app)
    participant M as Middleware<br/>auth · can · throttle
    participant R as Form request
    participant J as JournalEntry API
    participant S as Service / Actions
    participant DB as Database

    C->>M: POST /api/v1/accounting/journal-entries<br/>Bearer token · Idempotency-Key: inv-1001
    alt no / invalid token
        M-->>C: 401 Unauthenticated
    else missing permission
        M-->>C: 403 Forbidden
    else over rate limit
        M-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
    end
    M->>R: authorised request
    R->>R: account_code → chart_of_account_id<br/>currency_code → currency_id
    alt validation fails
        R-->>C: 422 { message, errors }
    end
    R->>J: validated data
    J->>DB: Idempotency-Key seen before?
    alt same key + same body
        DB-->>J: existing entry
        J-->>C: 200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true
    else same key + different body
        J-->>C: 422 key reused
    end
    J->>S: create (+ post when auto_post)
    S->>DB: BEGIN · insert entry + lines · checks · COMMIT
    alt accounting rule broken (unbalanced, closed period…)
        S-->>C: 422 { message }
    end
    DB-->>S: entry id
    S-->>J: entry with lines
    J-->>C: 201 { data: entry, totals, lines with account codes }
